his forecast conservative."}, {"title": "How sure we are", "text": "We run 20,000 scenarios that vary every uncertain input. P50 is the middle; P90 is the level demand beats in 9 of 10 scenarios, the safe number to lend against. On held-out metered sites the real demand fell inside our P90-P10 range in 5 of 6 site-years."}], "inputs": [{"label": "Building footprints", "source": "VIDA merge of Google, Microsoft and OSM Open Buildings (satellite-derived)", "refresh_days": 365, "value": "234 buildings", "as_of": "2026-10-31"}, {"label": "Schools, clinics, markets, mills, roads", "source": "OpenStreetMap", "refresh_days": 180, "value": "0 school, 0 health, 0 market, 0 mill", "as_of": "2026-10-31"}, {"label": "Solar resource", "source": "NASA POWER long-term monthly climatology", "refresh_days": 3650, "value": "5.629 kWh/m\u00b2/day", "as_of": "2026-10-31"}, {"label": "Grid lines", "source": "GridFinder (Arderne et al. 2020)", "as_of": "2020", "refresh_days": 730, "value": "9.032 km to nearest line"}, {"label": "Consumption, cost and tariff benchmarks", "source": "AMDA Benchmarking Africa's Minigrids 2024", "as_of": "2024", "refresh_days": 730, "value": "8.1 / 39.8 kWh per household / business"}, {"label": "Growth curves (metered mini-grids)", "source": "3 DR Congo mini-grids, 38-70 months each (Lunanga et al. 2026)", "as_of": "2024-12", "refresh_days": 120, "value": "ramp shapes for connections and consumption"}], "site_data_fetched_at": "2026-10-31T09:25:24+00:00", "site_data_age_days": 0}, "actuals": null, "ledger": {"forecast_id": "884fe8faabfe75a6", "issued_at": "2026-10-31T16:19:17+00:00", "site_id": "ng-kd-kabai", "name": "Kabai", "y3_p90": 69.9, "y3_p50": 216.5, "y3_p10": 638.9, "status": "awaiting metered data"}}